    "label": "thm:kl_prod",
    "number": "Theorem 1",
    "quote": "Running WSU-UX with loss estimators based on $\\tilde \\ell_{t}, t\\in[T]$ with $\\gamma = \\frac{\\eta K}{2}, \\eta = \\Theta(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\log(K)}{KT}})$ guarantees the following regret bound $\\sum_{t=1}^T \\E[\\ell_{t,A_t} - \\ell_{t,i^*}] \\leq O(\\sqrt{KT\\log(K)})$."
   },
   "confidence": "high",
   "notes": "Loss-biased WSU-UX; losses in [0,1]."
  },
